# UI-Only Change Scope

- Do not change backend code or non-UI logic when the request is for UI fixes.
- Do not change backend code or non-UI logic unless the user explicitly gives permission in the current conversation.
- Keep changes focused on presentation-layer files (UI components, styling, UI copy, and UI interaction polish) unless explicit authorization is provided.
